			description: [
				"&ePink Slime&r is this mod's signature material - you make it, breed the Pink Slime mob, and render it into ingots."
				""
				"Pink Slime Ingots plus plastic build the &ePity Machine Frame&r, the tier-1 chassis every basic machine is crafted around."
			]
