		{
			dependencies: ["0F16000000000004"]
			description: [
				"The payoff. An &eOre Laser Base&r fires colored lenses into the void below it and pulls &oraw ore&r straight out - no mining, no sieving. Different lens colors weight it toward different ores."
				""
				"A &eLaser Drill&r on top aims it. Stack multiple bases around one drill for real throughput. This is the closest the pack has to a quarry - drop it on a planet and it eats the crust."
			]
