		{
			dependencies: ["0F16000000000001"]
			description: [
				"&eIndustrial Foregoing: Souls&r bolts a soul economy onto the IF machines you already run."
				""
				"Mob deaths generate soul energy, which is piped around with the &eSoul Network Pipe&r and spent to accelerate and empower IF machinery. The &eSoul Laser Base&r is the hub the rest of it plugs into."
				""
				"This is the closest thing the pack has to a dedicated mob-farm mod - LaserIO's stablemates &eMob Grinding Utils&r and &eWoot&r have no Forge 1.20.1 build, so this fills that gap."
			]
