		{
			description: [
				"The &eLaser Drill&r fires into the void beneath it and produces ore, biased by the coloured &eLenses&r you surround it with."
				""
				"&e&lThis is the single most useful IF machine on a skyblock.&r It needs no terrain - it generates ore from power and depth alone. Place it, aim it downward into nothing, and it produces."
				""
				"&e&lLens colour changes the odds.&r Each ore is weighted to a colour; ring the drill with lenses of one colour and that ore dominates the output. Check JEI for the colour-to-ore mapping."
				""
				"&c&lDepth matters.&r Output improves the lower the drill sits, which on a floating island means building a shaft down toward the void."
				""
				"&7Slow and power-hungry, but completely passive and it never runs out.&r"
			]
			icon: "industrialforegoing:laser_drill"
			id: "04B16030A5EA3BCD"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2643DC47E4C0679E"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 30
