		}
		{
			description: [
				"A &ePlant Sower&r plants seeds in its working area; a &ePlant Gatherer&r harvests everything grown there."
				""
				"&e&lUnlike the Cyclic Harvester, this pair replants.&r Sower and Gatherer sharing a range is a complete closed farm - no Botany Pots, no Mystical Agriculture regrowth needed."
				""
				"&e&lIt harvests trees too&r, including the leaves, which makes it the easiest automatic wood and sapling farm in the pack."
				""
				"&7Set the working area with a Range Addon. Bigger range costs more power and more time per cycle.&r"
				""
				"&8The Gatherer also produces Sludge as a by-product - feed it to the Sludge Refiner rather than voiding it."
			]
			icon: "industrialforegoing:plant_gatherer"
			id: "1619ADCB3AD360EF"
			rewards: [{
				id: "07D4CEC92D2A5F0E"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 30
