			title: "&2Plant Gatherer & Sower"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"The &eMob Duplicator&r spawns mobs from Essence and a captured soul; the &eMob Slaughter Factory&r kills everything in its range and collects the drops."
				""
				"&e&lTogether they are a complete mob farm in two blocks&r - no platform, no spawn conditions, no fall damage, no player nearby."
				""
				"&e&lEssence is the fuel&r, produced by the Mob Slaughter Factory itself or by the Enchantment Extractor. The loop can be made self-sustaining once running."
				""
				"&7Use a Mob Imprisonment Tool to capture the mob you want, then put it in the Duplicator.&r"
				""
				"&8The Slaughter Factory also outputs Pink Slime, which has its own uses and its own slightly alarming mob."
			]
			icon: "industrialforegoing:mob_duplicator"
			id: "7F62FC57B50E7F52"
			rewards: [{
				id: "05930D60002AEFFE"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 30
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Industrial mob farming"
			tasks: [
