		{
			description: [
				"The &eMaterial Stonework Factory&r performs a programmable chain of stone operations - crush, smelt, cut, shape - in one machine."
				""
				"&e&lIt replaces a whole row of machines.&r Cobble in, and out comes whatever you configured: gravel, sand, smooth stone, slabs, or anything down that chain."
				""
				"&7Configure the operation list in its GUI. Each step is applied in order, so you can go cobble to gravel to sand to glass in a single pass.&r"
				""
				"&8Genuinely useful in this pack, where cobblestone is infinite and everything downstream of it is a bottleneck."
			]
			icon: "industrialforegoing:material_stonework_factory"
			id: "206210E20694CB96"
			rewards: [{
