		{
			description: [
				"&2&lYou have automated the things a void island cannot naturally do.&r"
				""
				"Ore from a laser pointed at nothing. Crops planted and harvested by machines. Mobs spawned and slaughtered on demand. Enchantments stripped and reapplied. And storage measured in the millions."
				""
				"&7Industrial Foregoing is the most &lskyblock-shaped&r mod in this pack - almost everything it does works without terrain, mobs or biomes.&r"
